Package: lblvm
Title: Latent Variable Modeling with Logit-Beta Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Seewoo", "Li", 
    email = "seewooli@g.ucla.edu", 
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Provides tools for logit-beta latent variable modeling (lblvm), a 
    latent variable modeling framework that combines a logit link with the beta 
    distribution. The logit link relates model parameters to observed data, 
    while the beta distribution models the error component. The framework 
    supports bounded continuous data and ordered categorical data.
